@@ -1,6 +1,10 @@
 9.1.0 - 2022-08-27
 ------------------
 
+* Fixed formatting of ranges whose iterators return temporary ranges that
+  only support non-const iteration, and debug formatting of nested character
+  and string ranges.
+
 * ``fmt::formatted_size`` now works at compile time
   (`#3026 <https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt/pull/3026>`_). For example
   (`godbolt <https://godbolt.org/z/1MW5rMdf8>`__):
